# scenesin Video Generator Rules
Created by Anouar Zeklat (Instagram: @anouar.co)

- Always create videos inside `output/<project-name>/`.
- Support 9:16 and 16:9 formats.
- Respect the 8 visual styles.
- Verify shot timings with `node bin/scenesin.mjs check <project>`.

